{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LOOPEDAL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the DJ for <strong>Fantasma Night Club</strong>, use your looping instruments to curate the vibe! <strong>Connect an instrument to your Output Device to send music to the speakers. Take requests from the crowd and keep the party going all night!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and drag to move and interact with instruments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect any instrument to the export machine to\u00a0play music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect multiple instruments to\u00a0mix new tunes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed two instruments into a LOOP PEDAL\u00a0and click save to store combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the crowd's requests and have fun creating your own loops!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958460?t=1758837667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958460/8085f3a48e43947f3509cca1a1de3e9e479fa23f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758837667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958460/a96520992a0b1f83c3641f5675476b275a7aa407/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758837667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958460/a96520992a0b1f83c3641f5675476b275a7aa407/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758837667","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LOOPEDAL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the DJ for <strong>Fantasma Night Club</strong>, use your looping instruments to curate the vibe! <strong>Connect an instrument to your Output Device to send music to the speakers. Take requests from the crowd and keep the party going all night!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and drag to move and interact with instruments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect any instrument to the export machine to\u00a0play music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect multiple instruments to\u00a0mix new tunes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed two instruments into a LOOP PEDAL\u00a0and click save to store combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill the crowd's requests and have fun creating your own loops!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fantasma Collective"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958460/d25adbe3bf32ccdc2136210d755aa8c743ab9fff/header.jpg?t=1758837667","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958460/2085304932/bd4298c88876934daa2859aff17689d21c43e0e9/1758836534/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758837611","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958460/2085304932/bd4298c88876934daa2859aff17689d21c43e0e9/1758836534/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758837611","highlight